# Task 8.4: Performance Optimization

Comprehensive performance audit and optimization across the full stack — database, frontend, and API layers — targeting Lighthouse scores > 90 and meeting all NFR-PERF targets from the [PRD](file:///c:/Users/zaidi/Downloads/compliance-dev%20(4)/compliance-dev/docs/PRD.md#L1859-L1938).

## NFR Targets (from PRD §8.1)

| NFR | Metric | Target |
|-----|--------|--------|
| PERF-001 | API p95 response | GET < 300ms, POST/PATCH < 500ms |
| PERF-004 | FCP | < 1.5s |
| PERF-004 | LCP | < 2.5s |
| PERF-004 | TTI | < 3.5s |
| PERF-005 | Simple DB queries | < 50ms |
| PERF-005 | Complex DB queries | < 200ms |
| PERF-005 | Score recalculation | < 100ms |

