#### [NEW] [analytics/components/analytics-charts.tsx](file:///c:/Users/zaidi/Downloads/compliance-dev%20(4)/compliance-dev/app/(user)/analytics/components/analytics-charts.tsx)

Extract recharts-dependent chart rendering from the monolithic analytics page into a dedicated component. This enables tree-shaking at the chunk boundary — the recharts bundle is only downloaded when the user navigates to analytics.

