### 7. Font and Critical CSS Optimization

#### [MODIFY] [app/layout.tsx](file:///c:/Users/zaidi/Downloads/compliance-dev%20(4)/compliance-dev/app/layout.tsx)

The Material Symbols font is loaded via a blocking `<link>` in the `<body>`. Optimize by:
1. Adding a `<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />` in the head.
2. Moving the font stylesheet to use `display=swap` if not already set.
3. Adding `rel="preload"` for the stylesheet, then loading it asynchronously.

This prevents the external font from blocking FCP/LCP.

